using S

~ start
Gatekeeper: The gatekeeper blocks your path. Coins: {{res(&"coins")}}.
- Bribe the gatekeeper [if res_coins >= 5 /]
	The gatekeeper takes your coins and steps aside.
	do add_res coins -5
- Show your key [if flag_has_key == true /]
	The gatekeeper nods and unlocks the gate.
- Walk away
	You turn back the way you came.
